From 8d348e148abbe7958286a68413ece034aa2662f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:42:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Sample the VR ray segment at depth-texel spacing

Refine both observed surfaces bordering an interval so a rejected nearer candidate cannot hide a valid middle layer. Derive the normal step count from the actual depth texture, retain bounded diagnostic overrides and test single-depth-texel foreground on the measured Index geometry.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_vr.cpp                | 24 +++++++++++++++---
 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_vr.h                  |  2 +-
 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_vr_math.h             | 23 +++++++++++++----
 .../shaders/rtx/pass/vr/vr_warp.comp.slang    | 24 ++++++++++++------
 tests/rtx/unit/test_vr_math.cpp               | 25 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

